    <briefdescription>
<para>Parallel checking between two ensembles which run on different set pes at the same time<linebreak/>
 There are two forms for the <computeroutput><ref refid="interfacempp__domains__mod_1_1mpp__check__field" kindref="compound">mpp_check_field</ref></computeroutput> call. The 2D version is generally to be used and 3D version is built by repeated calls to the 2D version.<linebreak/>
 <linebreak/>
Example usage: </para>    </briefdescription>
